    </div>

    <!-- Agents académiques & insights -->
    <div style="margin-top:28px">
      <div style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px">Agents notables — Recherche académique</div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
        <div style="padding:14px 16px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid var(--gold)">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--white);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px">ABA-PRO <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--gold);font-size:11px">— Aichholzer, Aurenhammer & Werner · Graz 2002</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">Premier agent à battre Gert Schnider (3× champion mondial). α-β depth 9-10 avec heuristic pruning (compacité + distance centre de masse). Limite : sur-élagage en fin de partie.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 16px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #7ec87e">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--white);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px">Abalearn <span style="font-weight:400;color:#7ec87e;font-size:11px">— Campos & Langlois · INESC-ID Lisbonne 2003</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">Premier agent TD-learning pour Abalone. Risk-seeking RL (κ=−1). Bat ELO 1448 en ligne, tient 3h30 contre ELO 1501 sans concéder un point. Paramètres : α=0.005 · λ=0.7 · γ=0.5.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 16px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #70b8e8">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--white);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px">AIBA <span style="font-weight:400;color:#70b8e8;font-size:11px">— Pascal Chorus · Maastricht Univ. 2009</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">Alpha-Beta vs Monte-Carlo : 60 parties, 60-0 pour α-β. MC n'éjecte que 3 billes au total. Meilleure fonction d'évaluation : ±1000 matériel · ±400 centre · ±320 cohésion · ±40 attaques.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 16px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #c890d0">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--white);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px">Nacre <span style="font-weight:400;color:#c890d0;font-size:11px">— Agent TD + deep search · non publié</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">TD-learning avec recherche > 1-ply. Citation : <em>"1 ply supplémentaire > davantage d'heuristiques"</em>. Critique ABA-PRO pour son pruning excessif en endgame — propose un pattern database d'end-games.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding:14px 16px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #e08050">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:var(--white);font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px">My Lovely Abalone <span style="font-weight:400;color:#e08050;font-size:11px">— Agent communautaire · non publié</span></div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">Minimax créé par un fan qui aurait battu ABA-PRO au niveau maximum. Intègre opening book + base de données de fin de partie. Cité comme preuve que le futur de l'IA Abalone viendra de la communauté.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Insights stratégiques -->
      <div style="margin-top:16px;background:rgba(200,168,75,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(200,168,75,0.2);border-radius:10px;padding:18px 20px">
        <div style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px">💡 Consensus académique — 4 sources, 2002-2009</div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65">
          <div>🎯 <strong style="color:var(--text)">Centre d'abord, attaque ensuite</strong> — Occuper le centre en opening est décisif. Attaquer avant d'avoir un groupe solide au centre = perdre en fin de partie.</div>
          <div>⚖️ <strong style="color:var(--text)">Avantage au 2ème joueur sur German Daisy</strong> — Si Noir avance trop tôt, Rouge pousse et fragmente son groupe immédiatement (Lee & Noh, Cornell/Princeton 2009).</div>
          <div>🔬 <strong style="color:var(--text)">Alpha-Beta >> Monte-Carlo</strong> — 60-0 en test. Monte-Carlo échoue car les coups aléatoires sont majoritairement mauvais à Abalone (Chorus 2009).</div>
          <div>⚠️ <strong style="color:var(--text)">Jeu défensif = partie infinie</strong> — Sans risk-seeking (κ < 0), l'agent ne pousse jamais et la partie ne se termine pas. Résolu par Abalearn avec κ=−1.</div>
          <div>📊 <strong style="color:var(--text)">Complexité — 4 sources convergentes</strong> — Branchement 60-80 coups · Durée ~87 coups · Game-tree 5×10¹⁵⁴ · État ~10²⁴.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
     MODAL — CONNEXION (étape 1)
══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-login">
  <div class="modal" style="width:460px">
    <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal('login')">×</button>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px">
      <div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%,#f0d080,#c8a84b);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px">🔐</div>
      <h3 style="margin:0">Bon retour !</h3>
    </div>
    <p>Connectez-vous à votre compte Abalone.</p>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label class="form-label">Email ou nom d'utilisateur</label>
      <input class="form-input" id="login-email" type="text" placeholder="olivier@exemple.com">
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="position:relative">
      <label class="form-label">Mot de passe</label>
      <input class="form-input" id="login-pw" type="password" placeholder="••••••••" style="padding-right:44px">
      <button onclick="togglePw('login-pw',this)" style="position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:10px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px">👁</button>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin:-6px 0 18px">
      <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer">
        <input type="checkbox" style="accent-color:var(--gold)"> Rester connecté
      </label>
      <a style="font-size:13px;color:var(--gold);cursor:pointer" onclick="closeModal('login');openModal('forgot')">Mot de passe oublié ?</a>
    </div>
    <button class="modal-submit" onclick="submitLogin()">Continuer →</button>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:18px 0">
      <div style="flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border)"></div>
      <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">ou continuer avec</span>
      <div style="flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border)"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:18px">
      <button class="social-btn" onclick="showToast('🔗 Connexion Google…')">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="#EA4335" d="M5.27 9.76A7.08 7.08 0 0 1 12 4.9c1.69 0 3.22.6 4.41 1.57l3.3-3.3A11.94 11.94 0 0 0 12 1C7.82 1 4.17 3.35 2.27 6.82l3 2.94Z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M16.04 18.01A7.06 7.06 0 0 1 12 19.1a7.08 7.08 0 0 1-6.72-4.82l-3.02 2.33A11.95 11.95 0 0 0 12 23c3.06 0 5.96-1.15 8.12-3.24l-4.08-1.75Z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M19.1 12c0-.65-.07-1.28-.18-1.9H12v3.6h4.01a3.43 3.43 0 0 1-1.49 2.25l4.08 1.75A11.93 11.93 0 0 0 20 12h-.9Z"/><path fill="#4285F4" d="M2.27 6.82A11.93 11.93 0 0 0 1 12c0 1.86.43 3.62 1.2 5.19l3.08-2.39A7.03 7.03 0 0 1 4.9 12c0-.78.13-1.53.37-2.24L2.27 6.82Z"/></svg>
        Google
      </button>
      <button class="social-btn" onclick="showToast('🔗 Connexion Discord…')">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#5865F2"><path d="M20.32 4.37a19.8 19.8 0 0 0-4.93-1.51.07.07 0 0 0-.08.04c-.21.38-.45.87-.61 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 0 0-5.49 0 12.57 12.57 0 0 0-.62-1.25.08.08 0 0 0-.08-.04 19.74 19.74 0 0 0-4.93 1.51.07.07 0 0 0-.03.03C1.77 8.87 1.1 13.25 1.4 17.57c0 .02.01.04.03.05a19.9 19.9 0 0 0 5.99 3.03.08.08 0 0 0 .09-.03 14.2 14.2 0 0 0 1.23-2 .08.08 0 0 0-.04-.1 13.1 13.1 0 0 1-1.87-.9.08.08 0 0 1-.01-.12c.13-.1.25-.2.37-.3a.07.07 0 0 1 .08-.01c3.93 1.8 8.18 1.8 12.06 0a.07.07 0 0 1 .08.01c.12.1.25.21.37.3a.08.08 0 0 1-.01.13 12.3 12.3 0 0 1-1.87.89.08.08 0 0 0-.04.11c.36.7.77 1.37 1.23 2a.08.08 0 0 0 .09.03 19.84 19.84 0 0 0 6-3.03.08.08 0 0 0 .03-.05c.37-3.83-.62-7.16-2.61-10.17a.06.06 0 0 0-.03-.03ZM8.52 15.38c-1.18 0-2.16-1.09-2.16-2.42s.96-2.42 2.16-2.42c1.21 0 2.17 1.1 2.16 2.42 0 1.33-.96 2.42-2.16 2.42Zm7.98 0c-1.18 0-2.16-1.09-2.16-2.42s.96-2.42 2.16-2.42c1.21 0 2.17 1.1 2.16 2.42 0 1.33-.95 2.42-2.16 2.42Z"/></svg>
        Discord
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-switch">Pas encore de compte ? <a onclick="closeModal('login');openModal('signup')">S'enregistrer gratuitement</a></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
     MODAL — DOUBLE AUTHENTIFICATION (étape 2)
══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-2fa">
  <div class="modal" style="width:460px">
    <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal('2fa')">×</button>

    <!-- Progress bar -->
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:24px">
      <div style="width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0d0f0e;flex-shrink:0">✓</div>
      <div style="flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--gold)"></div>
      <div style="width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(200,168,75,0.3);border:2px solid var(--gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0">2</div>
      <div style="flex:1;height:2px;background:var(--border)"></div>
      <div style="width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--surface2);border:2px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);flex-shrink:0">3</div>
    </div>

    <h3>Vérification en 2 étapes</h3>
    <p id="2fa-desc">Choisissez votre méthode de double authentification.</p>

    <!-- Method selector -->
    <div id="2fa-method-select">
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:20px">
        <div class="tfa-method-card" id="tfa-email" onclick="select2FAMethod('email')">
          <div class="tfa-icon">📧</div>
          <div class="tfa-label">Email</div>
          <div class="tfa-sublabel">Code à 6 chiffres par email</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tfa-method-card" id="tfa-sms" onclick="select2FAMethod('sms')">
          <div class="tfa-icon">📱</div>
          <div class="tfa-label">SMS</div>
          <div class="tfa-sublabel">Code par texto sur votre mobile</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tfa-method-card" id="tfa-totp" onclick="select2FAMethod('totp')">
          <div class="tfa-icon">🔑</div>
          <div class="tfa-label">Authenticator</div>
          <div class="tfa-sublabel">Google Auth, Authy, 1Password…</div>
        </div>
        <div class="tfa-method-card" id="tfa-yubikey" onclick="select2FAMethod('yubikey')">
          <div class="tfa-icon">🗝</div>
          <div class="tfa-label">YubiKey</div>
          <div class="tfa-sublabel">Clé de sécurité physique FIDO2</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="modal-submit" id="2fa-continue-btn" onclick="launch2FA()" disabled style="opacity:0.5">Continuer avec cette méthode</button>
    </div>

    <!-- Code input (email / sms / totp) -->
    <div id="2fa-code-input" style="display:none">
      <div id="2fa-send-status" style="padding:12px 16px;background:rgba(74,148,99,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(74,148,99,0.25);border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent-green-light);margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
        <span>✅</span><span id="2fa-send-msg"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label class="form-label" id="2fa-code-label">Code de vérification</label>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
          <input id="2fa-digit-1" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput(this,1)" onkeydown="otpBack(event,1)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-2" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput(this,2)" onkeydown="otpBack(event,2)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-3" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput(this,3)" onkeydown="otpBack(event,3)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-4" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput(this,4)" onkeydown="otpBack(event,4)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-5" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput(this,5)" onkeydown="otpBack(event,5)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-6" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput(this,6)" onkeydown="otpBack(event,6)">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin:-4px 0 18px">
        <button id="resend-btn" class="link-btn" onclick="resendCode()">🔄 Renvoyer le code</button>
        <span id="resend-timer" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)"></span>
      </div>
      <button class="modal-submit" onclick="verify2FACode()">Vérifier →</button>
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:14px">
        <a class="link-btn" onclick="show2FAMethodSelect()">← Changer de méthode</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- YubiKey prompt -->
    <div id="2fa-yubikey-prompt" style="display:none;text-align:center">
      <div style="width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(200,168,75,0.1);border:2px solid rgba(200,168,75,0.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:36px;margin:0 auto 20px">🗝</div>
      <div style="font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:8px">Insérez votre YubiKey</div>
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px">Branchez votre clé de sécurité USB et appuyez sur son bouton doré pour vous authentifier via FIDO2/WebAuthn.</div>
      <div class="yubikey-pulse" id="yubikey-pulse">
        <div style="width:60px;height:60px;border-radius:50%;border:3px solid var(--gold);animation:yubiPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;margin:0 auto">🔑</div>
      </div>
      <button class="modal-submit" style="margin-top:20px" onclick="simulateYubiKey()">Simuler la détection (démo)</button>
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px">
        <a class="link-btn" onclick="show2FAMethodSelect()">← Changer de méthode</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- TOTP QR -->
    <div id="2fa-totp-setup" style="display:none;text-align:center">
      <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px">Scannez ce QR code avec votre application authenticator (Google Authenticator, Authy, 1Password…)</div>
      <div id="qr-placeholder" style="width:160px;height:160px;margin:0 auto 16px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:10px">
        <canvas id="qr-canvas" width="140" height="140"></canvas>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px">Clé secrète (saisie manuelle)</div>
      <div style="font-family:'DM Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--gold);background:var(--surface2);padding:8px 14px;border-radius:6px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:20px;display:inline-block" id="totp-secret">ABLO KXYZ 3M7A BQNR</div>
      <div class="form-group" style="text-align:left">
        <label class="form-label">Entrez le code généré par l'app</label>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
          <input id="2fa-digit-1b" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput2(this,1)" onkeydown="otpBack2(event,1)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-2b" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput2(this,2)" onkeydown="otpBack2(event,2)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-3b" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput2(this,3)" onkeydown="otpBack2(event,3)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-4b" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput2(this,4)" onkeydown="otpBack2(event,4)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-5b" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput2(this,5)" onkeydown="otpBack2(event,5)">
          <input id="2fa-digit-6b" class="otp-digit" type="text" maxlength="1" oninput="otpInput2(this,6)" onkeydown="otpBack2(event,6)">
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="modal-submit" onclick="verifyTOTP()">Activer l'authentificator →</button>
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px">
        <a class="link-btn" onclick="show2FAMethodSelect()">← Changer de méthode</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
     MODAL — SUCCÈS CONNEXION (étape 3)
══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-login-success">
  <div class="modal" style="width:420px;text-align:center">
    <div style="width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(74,148,99,0.15);border:2px solid rgba(74,148,99,0.4);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:32px;margin:0 auto 20px">✅</div>
    <h3 style="margin-bottom:8px">Connexion réussie !</h3>
    <p style="margin-bottom:6px">Bienvenue sur Abalone, <strong style="color:var(--gold)" id="success-username">joueur</strong> !</p>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;background:rgba(74,148,99,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(74,148,99,0.2);border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent-green-light)">
      <span>🔒</span> <span id="success-2fa-method">Double authentification activée</span>
    </div>
    <button class="modal-submit" onclick="closeModal('login-success');showPage('profile')">Accéder à mon profil →</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
     MODAL — S'ENREGISTRER (étape 1)
══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-signup">
  <div class="modal" style="width:460px">
    <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal('signup')">×</button>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:6px">
      <div style="width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 35%,#f0d080,#c8a84b);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px">⚪</div>
      <h3 style="margin:0">Rejoignez Abalone</h3>
    </div>
    <p>Créez votre compte et jouez en moins d'une minute.</p>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label class="form-label">Nom d'utilisateur</label>
      <input class="form-input" id="signup-username" type="text" placeholder="MarbleKing42">
      <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px">Visible par les autres joueurs · min. 3 caractères</div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label class="form-label">Adresse email</label>
      <input class="form-input" id="signup-email" type="email" placeholder="vous@exemple.com">
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" style="position:relative">
      <label class="form-label">Mot de passe</label>
      <input class="form-input" id="signup-pw" type="password" placeholder="Au moins 8 caractères" oninput="checkPwStrength(this.value)" style="padding-right:44px">
      <button onclick="togglePw('signup-pw',this)" style="position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:10px;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px">👁</button>
      <div id="pw-strength-bar-2" style="height:3px;border-radius:2px;margin-top:6px;background:var(--border);overflow:hidden">
        <div id="pw-strength-fill-2" style="height:100%;width:0%;transition:all 0.3s;border-radius:2px"></div>
      </div>
      <div id="pw-strength-label-2" style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;margin-bottom:18px">
      <input type="checkbox" id="signup-terms" style="accent-color:var(--gold);margin-top:2px;flex-shrink:0">
      <label for="signup-terms" style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;line-height:1.5">J'accepte les <a style="color:var(--gold)">conditions d'utilisation</a> et la <a style="color:var(--gold)">politique de confidentialité</a></label>
    </div>
    <button class="modal-submit" onclick="submitSignup()">Créer mon compte →</button>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:16px 0">
      <div style="flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border)"></div>
      <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">ou</span>
      <div style="flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border)"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-bottom:16px">
      <button class="social-btn" onclick="showToast('🔗 Inscription Google…')">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="#EA4335" d="M5.27 9.76A7.08 7.08 0 0 1 12 4.9c1.69 0 3.22.6 4.41 1.57l3.3-3.3A11.94 11.94 0 0 0 12 1C7.82 1 4.17 3.35 2.27 6.82l3 2.94Z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M16.04 18.01A7.06 7.06 0 0 1 12 19.1a7.08 7.08 0 0 1-6.72-4.82l-3.02 2.33A11.95 11.95 0 0 0 12 23c3.06 0 5.96-1.15 8.12-3.24l-4.08-1.75Z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M19.1 12c0-.65-.07-1.28-.18-1.9H12v3.6h4.01a3.43 3.43 0 0 1-1.49 2.25l4.08 1.75A11.93 11.93 0 0 0 20 12h-.9Z"/><path fill="#4285F4" d="M2.27 6.82A11.93 11.93 0 0 0 1 12c0 1.86.43 3.62 1.2 5.19l3.08-2.39A7.03 7.03 0 0 1 4.9 12c0-.78.13-1.53.37-2.24L2.27 6.82Z"/></svg>
        Google
      </button>
      <button class="social-btn" onclick="showToast('🔗 Inscription Discord…')">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#5865F2"><path d="M20.32 4.37a19.8 19.8 0 0 0-4.93-1.51.07.07 0 0 0-.08.04c-.21.38-.45.87-.61 1.25a18.27 18.27 0 0 0-5.49 0 12.57 12.57 0 0 0-.62-1.25.08.08 0 0 0-.08-.04 19.74 19.74 0 0 0-4.93 1.51.07.07 0 0 0-.03.03C1.77 8.87 1.1 13.25 1.4 17.57c0 .02.01.04.03.05a19.9 19.9 0 0 0 5.99 3.03.08.08 0 0 0 .09-.03 14.2 14.2 0 0 0 1.23-2 .08.08 0 0 0-.04-.1 13.1 13.1 0 0 1-1.87-.9.08.08 0 0 1-.01-.12c.13-.1.25-.2.37-.3a.07.07 0 0 1 .08-.01c3.93 1.8 8.18 1.8 12.06 0a.07.07 0 0 1 .08.01c.12.1.25.21.37.3a.08.08 0 0 1-.01.13 12.3 12.3 0 0 1-1.87.89.08.08 0 0 0-.04.11c.36.7.77 1.37 1.23 2a.08.08 0 0 0 .09.03 19.84 19.84 0 0 0 6-3.03.08.08 0 0 0 .03-.05c.37-3.83-.62-7.16-2.61-10.17a.06.06 0 0 0-.03-.03ZM8.52 15.38c-1.18 0-2.16-1.09-2.16-2.42s.96-2.42 2.16-2.42c1.21 0 2.17 1.1 2.16 2.42 0 1.33-.96 2.42-2.16 2.42Zm7.98 0c-1.18 0-2.16-1.09-2.16-2.42s.96-2.42 2.16-2.42c1.21 0 2.17 1.1 2.16 2.42 0 1.33-.95 2.42-2.16 2.42Z"/></svg>
        Discord
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-switch">Déjà inscrit ? <a onclick="closeModal('signup');openModal('login')">Se connecter</a></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════
     MODAL — MOT DE PASSE OUBLIÉ
══════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-forgot">
  <div class="modal" style="width:420px">
    <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeModal('forgot')">×</button>
    <div style="font-size:36px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px">🔓</div>
    <h3 style="text-align:center">Mot de passe oublié</h3>
    <p style="text-align:center">Entrez votre email pour recevoir un lien de réinitialisation sécurisé.</p>
    <div class="form-group">
      <label class="form-label">Adresse email</label>
      <input class="form-input" type="email" placeholder="vous@exemple.com">
    </div>
    <button class="modal-submit" onclick="closeModal('forgot');showToast('📧 Email de réinitialisation envoyé !')">Envoyer le lien</button>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:14px">
      <a class="link-btn" onclick="closeModal('forgot');openModal('login')">← Retour à la connexion</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ─── TOAST ─── -->
<div class="toast" id="toast"><span class="toast-icon"></span><span id="toast-msg"></span></div>

<!-- ─── AIDE TRADUCTION NAVIGATEUR ─── -->
<div id="translate-hint-overlay" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:3500;background:rgba(13,15,14,0.92);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px">
  <div style="max-width:440px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--gold-dim);border-radius:16px;padding:28px;text-align:center">
    <div style="font-size:48px;margin-bottom:8px"><span id="translate-hint-flag">🌐</span></div>
    <h3 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--white);font-size:22px;margin-bottom:6px">Traduire en <span id="translate-hint-lang" style="color:var(--gold)">English</span></h3>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:8px" id="translate-hint-text"></p>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:20px">Votre navigateur traduira instantanément toute la page dans la langue choisie. C'est gratuit et complet. 🚀</p>
    <button onclick="closeTranslateHint()" style="padding:11px 28px;background:var(--gold);border:none;border-radius:8px;color:#0d0f0e;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif">J'ai compris</button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ─── TUTORIEL INTERACTIF ─── -->
<div id="tutorial-overlay" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:3000;background:rgba(13,15,14,0.96);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px">
  <div style="width:100%;max-width:560px;text-align:center">
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:8px">
      <div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold)" id="tuto-step-label">Étape 1 / 5</div>
      <button onclick="closeTutorial()" style="background:none;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-size:22px;cursor:pointer">✕</button>
    </div>
    <h2 id="tuto-title" style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;color:var(--white);margin-bottom:8px">Bienvenue !</h2>
    <p id="tuto-text" style="font-size:14px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;min-height:60px"></p>
    <canvas id="tuto-board" width="400" height="400" style="border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--border),0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);cursor:pointer;max-width:100%"></canvas>
    <div id="tuto-feedback" style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;min-height:24px;margin-top:12px;color:var(--gold)"></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-top:8px">
      <button id="tuto-prev" onclick="tutorialPrev()" style="padding:10px 20px;background:none;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif">⟨ Précédent</button>
      <button id="tuto-next" onclick="tutorialNext()" style="padding:10px 24px;background:var(--gold);border:none;color:#0d0f0e;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif">Suivant ⟩</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

